[00:12.500]I live inside my own world of make-believe
{"我活在自己虚构的世界里"}
[00:18.200]Kids screaming in their cradles, profanities
{"孩童在摇篮中尖叫着污言秽语"}
[00:24.500]I see the world through eyes covered in ink and bleach
{"透过被墨水和漂白剂蒙蔽的双眼看世界"}
[00:30.500]Cross out the ones who heard my cries and watched me weep
{"划掉那些听见我哭泣却冷眼旁观的人"}
[00:36.900]I love everything
{"我热爱万物"}
[00:38.500]Fire spreading all around my room
{"火焰在我的房间四处蔓延"}
[00:42.900]My world's so bright
{"我的世界如此明亮"}
[00:44.500]It's hard to breathe but that's alright
{"难以呼吸但没关系"}
[00:47.600]Hush
{"嘘"}
[00:59.300]Sh...
[01:12.599]Tape my eyes open to force reality(oh no no)
{"用胶带撑开双眼强迫面对现实（哦不不）"}
[01:18.599]Why can't you just let me eat my weight in glee?
{"为何不能让我尽情沉溺于欢愉？"}
[01:24.599]I live inside my own world of make-believe
{"我活在自己虚构的世界里"}
[01:30.599]Kids screaming in their cradles, profanities
{"孩童在摇篮中尖叫着污言秽语"}
[01:35.700]Some days I feel skinnier than all the other days
{"某些日子我感觉比其它时候更形销骨立"}
[01:42.599]Sometimes I can't tell if my body belongs to me
{"有时分不清这副躯体是否属于自己"}
[01:48.599]I love everything
{"我热爱万物"}
[01:51.300]Fire spreading all around my room
{"火焰在我的房间四处蔓延"}
[01:54.700]My world's so bright
{"我的世界如此明亮"}
[01:55.900]It's hard to breathe but that's alright
{"难以呼吸但没关系"}
[01:59.599]Hush.
{"嘘"}
[02:10.599]Sh...
[02:24.199]I wanna taste your content
{"我想品尝你满足的模样"}
[02:26.699]Hold your breath and feel the tension
{"屏住呼吸感受这紧绷张力"}
[02:29.699]Devils hide behind redemption
{"恶魔潜伏在救赎背后"}
[02:32.699]Honesty is one-way gate to hell
{"诚实是通往地狱的单行道"}
[02:35.900]I wanna taste consumption
{"我想尝尝自我毁灭的滋味"}
[02:38.800]Breathe faster to waste oxygen
{"加速呼吸来浪费氧气"}
[02:41.000]Hear the children sing aloud
{"听孩子们放声歌唱"}
[02:44.599]It's music till the wick burns out
{"这是烛芯燃尽前的音乐"}
[02:47.699]Hush
{"嘘"}
[03:00.099]Just wanna be care free lately, yeah
{"最近只想无忧无虑 耶"}
[03:05.099]Just kicking up daisies
{"只是踢着雏菊嬉戏"}
[03:07.998]Got one too many quarters in my pockets
{"口袋里硬币多到叮当响"}
[03:11.099]Count 'em like the four leaf clovers in my locket
{"像数四叶草般清点挂坠里的珍藏"}
[03:14.998]Untied laces, yeah, just tripping on daydreams
{"散开的鞋带 耶 只是沉溺于白日梦乡"}
[03:19.998]Got dirty little lullabies playing on repeat
{"肮脏的摇篮曲在循环播放"}
[03:24.998]Might as well just rot around the nursery and count sheep
{"不如在育婴室腐烂着数绵羊"}
